# What reaches the image build: server/ and docs/, nothing else.
#
# For a Cloud Run deploy the upload is already narrowed by .gcloudignore, so
# this file earns its keep on a local `docker build .` — without it the build
# context would include the 3.2 GB of CAD and STLs in mechanical/.
#
# Listed as plain exclusions rather than an allowlist ("*" plus re-inclusions)
# because exclusions behave the same in every Docker version and need no
# reasoning about which parent directory was excluded first.

.git/
.github/
firmware/
mechanical/
electronics/
controller/

# Deployment tooling and repository documentation are not part of the running
# site. Anchored at the context root, so docs/README.md — which is served with
# the rest of the site — is untouched.
deploy_google_cloud.sh
deploy_google_cloud.env
deploy_google_cloud.env.example
README.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
LICENSE
LICENSE-hardware

# Tests run before deployment, not inside the image.
server/*_test.go
server/README.md

.DS_Store
